{"id":26868,"title":"Bonus: Game. Geometric shapes","lessonId":10752,"moduleNumber":4,"type":"regular","isBonus":true,"levels":[{"id":329858,"position":1,"type":"scratch","title":"Arcade — geometric shapes","levelScore":1,"isAllowFail":false,"hide":false,"config":{"fail":"","hint":"","msgs":"","tips":[],"type":"scratch","user":170903,"hints":[{"id":"23081ddb-76e9-4de8-8ec2-fc979844f5f6","url":"","text":"The ball is affected by gravity if it does not touch the platforms.","type":"gif","title":"Gravity","evaluationType":"markCompleted"},{"id":"a9aa5d76-0794-4252-8286-3384653a8f9a","url":"","text":"There are only two rules: touching the \"lava\" (red) and the target — the green shape.","type":"gif","title":"Rules","evaluationType":"markCompleted"},{"id":"c9ef952c-1fd1-464c-9bd5-c5148d7938ca","url":"","text":"We can only control the jumping of the shape. Program a jump that occurs only when you touch the platform (to be able to bounce off).","type":"gif","title":"Jump","evaluationType":"markCompleted"},{"id":"8cd92fc4-c45c-444b-955f-3e75b86e3a91","url":"","text":"The balloon returns to the starting position whenever the background changes or it touches lava. We need a procedure for that.","type":"gif","title":"Going to the beginning of the level","evaluationType":"markCompleted"},{"id":"8586f36d-4b58-4635-a1d5-8818b8ca6391","url":"","text":"","type":"gif","title":"Initial placement","evaluationType":"markCompleted"},{"id":"45079e22-e48d-413a-a2e5-9ba95f2d289f","url":"","text":"Add new levels and change rules and controls.","type":"gif","title":"*Bonus: modify the game as you see fit.","taskType":"bonus","evaluationType":"markCompleted"}],"title":"","comics":[],"popups":[],"congrat":"","project":10581129,"language":"eng-ENG","question":"","quizData":{"items":[{"id":"1550496479183-4","text":"","image":null,"categories":[]}],"choices":[{"id":"1550496479183-1","text":"","image":null,"correct":false},{"id":"1550496479183-2","text":"","image":null,"correct":false}],"comment":